Actually, that is just one of the possible ways in which you can use it.

You can also apply it to yourself (direction s). You get just a little
bit more information about your state of being than what you're seeing
on the bottom line, which might sometimes be helpful.

The most useful use of the stethoscope, however, is to apply it to other
creatures. You can see how many HP they've got left, which can make a
life or death difference in some situations. It is helpful to know that
the first use each turn of a stethoscope in this way does *not* take a
turn, so the monster you're fighting doesn't get an extra hit in.

